{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Marble Heartstrings",
    "steam_appid": 3633310,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daydreaming again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About a cute anime girl with angelic voice playing marbles with me, never calling me childish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hey nerd, you&quot;<br>&quot;Is that...a bishoujo's voice? Am I hallucinating?&quot;<br>&quot;If you beat me at pachinko, I'll give you a reward~&quot;<br>&quot;Huh?&quot;<br>&quot;Complete the final challenge and I'll be yours\u2764&quot;<br>If this is a dream, I don't want to wake up...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim carefully before launching marbles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target objectives, adjust power, fire! Collisions, bounces, rolls... Each marble has unique traits - nurture them strategically for higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out! Marbles leaving the arena might hit the bishoujo! Oh? She reacts differently? Now I have to &quot;accidentally&quot; miss~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect components to build your marble arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock walls, pits and more by completing challenges! Arrange them creatively to create marvelous chain reactions! Dozens of unique components await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: The bishoujo materialized your childhood doodles. Say thanks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just focus on shooting - physics engine handles the rest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our realistic yet whimsical physics system ensures every shot feels unique. Don't worry, she'll guide you~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This bishoujo's kinda mid&quot;<br>--But she plays games with me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Look, the model's clipping. Zero immersion&quot;<br>--But she plays games with me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Okay whatever, it's just a 2D waifu...&quot;<br>--BUT SHE SAYS SHE LOVES ME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[We had grander visions but limited by budget/skills... Still hope you'll enjoy our labor of love!]</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daydreaming again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About a cute anime girl with angelic voice playing marbles with me, never calling me childish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hey nerd, you&quot;<br>&quot;Is that...a bishoujo's voice? Am I hallucinating?&quot;<br>&quot;If you beat me at pachinko, I'll give you a reward~&quot;<br>&quot;Huh?&quot;<br>&quot;Complete the final challenge and I'll be yours\u2764&quot;<br>If this is a dream, I don't want to wake up...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim carefully before launching marbles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target objectives, adjust power, fire! Collisions, bounces, rolls... Each marble has unique traits - nurture them strategically for higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out! Marbles leaving the arena might hit the bishoujo! Oh? She reacts differently? Now I have to &quot;accidentally&quot; miss~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect components to build your marble arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock walls, pits and more by completing challenges! Arrange them creatively to create marvelous chain reactions! Dozens of unique components await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: The bishoujo materialized your childhood doodles. Say thanks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just focus on shooting - physics engine handles the rest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our realistic yet whimsical physics system ensures every shot feels unique. Don't worry, she'll guide you~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This bishoujo's kinda mid&quot;<br>--But she plays games with me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Look, the model's clipping. Zero immersion&quot;<br>--But she plays games with me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Okay whatever, it's just a 2D waifu...&quot;<br>--BUT SHE SAYS SHE LOVES ME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[We had grander visions but limited by budget/skills... Still hope you'll enjoy our labor of love!]</p>",
    "short_description": "If you just want to dash into holes and shoot things, play pinball! But why do girls still bother me even in pinball?! Control a meme-powered ball, collect quirky parts, build unique boards, master the physics engine, and break through anime girls' defenses until the climax (story-wise)!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
